# HOUP-106: EAS Build archives the project tree to build server-side. Keep
# this in sync with .gitignore's exclusions, plus paths .gitignore doesn't
# need to cover but that don't belong in an EAS upload.
node_modules
.expo
dist
web-build
android
ios

# The HOUP-71 spike hit an EAS archive failure on a Windows-created symlink
# at the repo root (.agents/skills) — excluded defensively since apps/mobile's
# EAS project root can still see paths above it in the monorepo tree.
.agents
